### GET ALL -obtener todos los provincias
GET http://localhost:3000/api/provinces

### GET ALL ACTIVE-obtener todos los provincias activas
GET http://localhost:3000/api/provinces/active

### ID

### GET ONE - obtener una provincia
GET http://localhost:3000/api/provinces/1

### POST - crear una nueva provincia
# @name createProvincee
POST http://localhost:3000/api/provinces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameProvince": "AlanLandia",
  "cities": []
}

### PUT - modificar una provincia
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/provinces/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameProvince": "Juan"
}

### PATCH - modificar una provincia
PATCH  http://localhost:3000/api/provinces/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": false,
  "nameProvince": "Juana"
}

### PATCH - Dar de baja ciudades y provincia
PATCH  http://localhost:3000/api/provinces/1/toggle-state
Content-Type: application/json

{
}
